for noticing the feeling without acting on it.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C02-B08","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"The figure reaches toward the black knot without touching it, while the shadow pauses at the window sill; presents jealousy as something that can be examined rather than immediately justified or erased.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C02-B09","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"Reuse the reaching figure and paused shadow, with a thin gold line appearing between the fingers and the knot; suggests a question forming between emotional reaction and conscious understanding.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":false,"reuse_image_id":"C02-B08"},{"id":"C02-B10","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"The window reflection shows an indistinct anonymous silhouette touched by warm gold, while the foreground figure remains in charcoal; introduces the other person as a mirror for inner comparison.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C02-B11","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"Reuse the window reflection, but let the gold silhouette overlap faintly with the foreground figure's reflection; connects the perceived success outside with a disowned possibility inside.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":false,"reuse_image_id":"C02-B10"},{"id":"C02-B12","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"The figure studies the overlapping reflections instead of looking directly at the gold silhouette; shifts the question from what the other person has to what the reaction reveals.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C02-B13","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"The oversized shadow stretches across the sill and touches the gold reflection without engulfing it; visualizes shadow material becoming visible at the boundary of awareness.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C02-B14","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"Reuse the window boundary and reaching shadow, while the foreground figure takes one cautious step closer; shows movement from self-accusation toward curious observation.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":false,"reuse_image_id":"C02-B13"},{"id":"C02-B15","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"The figure opens one hand toward the chest knot as the knot loosens into irregular charcoal strokes; depicts allowing the feeling to be acknowledged without endorsing harmful behavior.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C02-B16","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"The loosened black strokes travel across the floor toward the window, forming a narrow path beside the gold opening; turns jealousy into a clue pointing toward an unrecognized desire.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C02-B17","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"Reuse the figure, window, and gold opening, with the shadow now standing beside rather than over the figure; presents the shadow as a part to notice rather than an enemy to destroy.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":false,"reuse_image_id":"C02-B16"},{"id":"C02-B18","script_section":"S2","visual_information":"The figure faces the window quietly as the gold opening remains narrow and the shadow rests along the sill; ends the reframe by inviting inquiry into what the other person's success has touched within the self.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null}]}
