 narrow gold opening; this reinforces coexistence between restraint and admitted longing.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":false,"reuse_image_id":"C04-B13"},{"id":"C04-B15","script_section":"S4","visual_information":"The figure lowers the hand from the chest while the black knot becomes smaller but remains visible; this shows integration as acknowledgment rather than forced disappearance.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C04-B16","script_section":"S4","visual_information":"The figure faces the window with relaxed shoulders as a narrow gold path crosses the sill without touching the outside silhouette; this separates personal possibility from rivalry.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C04-B17","script_section":"S4","visual_information":"The same relaxed figure remains at the window while the gold path continues inward from the sill; this sustains the idea that another person's success can redirect attention toward one's own path.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":false,"reuse_image_id":"C04-B16"},{"id":"C04-B18","script_section":"S4","visual_information":"The inside figure and the distant gold-lit silhouette stand on opposite sides of the same window, connected only by a faint gold reflection; this shows that non-attack and self-recognition can coexist.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C04-B19","script_section":"S4","visual_information":"The figure stands quietly beside the window with the shadow aligned behind the body and one small gold opening held near the chest; this concludes the movement with an image of emerging self-integration.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null}]}
