d visibly linking both paper forms; preserves the established contradiction while adding continuity.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":false,"reuse_image_id":"C05-B06"},{"id":"C05-B09","script_section":"S5","visual_information":"The figure lowers the photograph from its pedestal and holds it beside the body; shifts the past from sacred object to part of personal history.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C05-B10","script_section":"S5","visual_information":"The bright past imprint loses its clean edge and reveals rough charcoal marks underneath; shows idealization making room for complexity.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C05-B11","script_section":"S5","visual_information":"The figure places the imperfect photograph on the same paper plane as the present self; visualizes neither rejection nor worship.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C05-B12","script_section":"S5","visual_information":"The attached shadow separates slightly from the figure and curves back toward the photograph without breaking the gold thread; shows excluded aspects becoming consciously visible.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C05-B13","script_section":"S5","visual_information":"The present figure and past imprint stand at equal scale on opposite sides of a shallow paper boundary; represents holding difference without forcing identity.","mode":"metaphor","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C05-B14","script_section":"S5","visual_information":"Reuse the equal-scale figure and past imprint as the boundary softens into a charcoal seam; preserves the established meaning while suggesting integration.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":false,"reuse_image_id":"C05-B13"},{"id":"C05-B15","script_section":"S5","visual_information":"The figure lets the photograph rest on the ground and takes one step forward with the gold thread still attached; shows movement without erasing the past.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null},{"id":"C05-B16","script_section":"S5","visual_information":"Wide off-white paper field with the present figure, imperfect photograph, attached shadow, and one continuous gold thread in balanced relation; concludes with conscious placement rather than praise or condemnation.","mode":"symbolic","new_image":true,"reuse_image_id":null}]}
